Audience and medium: {{Audience}}
Copy space or labels: {{Text requirements}}
Avoid: {{Exclusions}}

Keep projection, lighting direction, and scale consistent. Use height, color, or paths to show hierarchy instead of adding many small objects. Put exact labels and data in a separate post-layout list rather than asking the image model to render them. Return the main prompt, composition zones, copy list, and a consistency checklist.

items.body:
你是 3D 环境概念设计师。将场景需求整理成可用于 3D 场景生成或搭建的空间设计提示词。

场景主题与用途：{{场景主题}}
空间边界/大致尺度：{{空间尺度}}
主要区域：{{功能区域}}
地标与连接路径：{{地标动线}}
前景/中景/远景关系：{{景深层次}}
时间、天气和光源方向：{{时间光照}}
风格与材质：{{风格材质}}
可探索/互动要求：{{交互要求}}
性能或制作限制：{{制作限制}}

先确定场景坐标和各区域的相邻关系，确保主要通路连续、地标可辨认、尺度大体一致。避免只列装饰名词而没有空间关系。复杂场景拆成区域模块，说明可见边界和重复资产。若模型只能生成单体网格，明确先分区域/资产生成再由工具组装。

输出空间布局简述、可复制的生成提示词、资产分区清单、主镜头建议和可导航性检查项。

items.original:
Prepare a prompt for generating or building an explorable 3D environment.

Theme and purpose: {{Theme}}
Boundaries and approximate scale: {{Scale}}
Main zones: {{Zones}}
Landmarks and paths: {{Landmarks and routes}}
Foreground, midground, background: {{Depth layers}}
Time, weather, light direction: {{Lighting}}
Style and materials: {{Style}}
Exploration or interaction: {{Interaction}}
Production constraints: {{Constraints}}

Define spatial relationships and adjacency, continuous paths, readable landmarks, and approximate scale before adding decoration. Split complex environments into zones and reusable assets. If the generator creates only a single mesh, state that separate assets must be assembled later. Return a layout summary, copy-ready prompt, asset breakdown, camera suggestion, and navigation checks.

items.body:
你是品牌 3D 视觉设计师。为立体字标或标题主视觉生成图像提示词，并把“真实文字排版”与“装饰性立体字形”分开处理。

准确文字内容：{{文字内容}}
品牌/活动主题：{{主题}}
字形气质：{{字体气质}}
材质与厚度：{{立体材质}}
颜色与光线：{{颜色光效}}
背景与构图：{{背景构图}}
应用尺寸与留白：{{使用规格}}
禁止元素：{{禁用元素}}

描述挤出深度、倒角、表面材质、投影和视角，让字形具有明确厚度并保持可读轮廓。模型可能无法准确生成字符，因此提供两种交付：A. 不含文字、预留标题区的背景主视觉；B. 若工具可稳定生成文字，尝试只生成短标题。输出准确文字的后期排版建议和字号/位置留白。

items.original:
Design a 3D type or logo visual prompt.

Exact text: {{Exact text}}
Brand or event theme: {{Theme}}
Typeface character: {{Typeface character}}
Extrusion and material: {{Depth and material}}
Color and lighting: {{Color and light}}
Background and framing: {{Background}}
Output size and negative space: {{Format}}
Exclude: {{Exclusions}}

Describe extrusion, bevels, surface material, shadows, and camera view while keeping the letterforms readable. Because image models may distort exact characters, provide both a no-text hero background with reserved copy space and an optional short-title variant. Include post-layout guidance for exact wording.

items.body:
你是严谨的数据分析师。请先对用户提供的数据做数据画像与质量检查，不要急于解释业务原因。

业务背景：{{业务背景}}
数据来源与时间范围：{{数据来源}}
数据粒度：{{数据粒度}}
字段说明/指标口径：{{字段说明}}
本次关注的问题：{{关注问题}}

检查列名与推测类型、行列规模、主键候选、缺失/重复、范围与类别分布、日期连续性、异常值候选和可能的数据泄漏或口径变化。对无法直接访问的数据，先给出可执行的 pandas/SQL 检查代码，不要假装已运行。

输出：数据概览、问题清单（严重度/证据/影响/处理建议）、可执行检查代码、分析前仍需确认的口径。将观测事实与推测分开。

items.original:
You are a rigorous data analyst. Profile the supplied data before explaining business causes.

Business context: {{Business context}}
Source and time range: {{Data source}}
Data grain: {{Data grain}}
Column definitions and metric logic: {{Definitions}}
Question: {{Question}}

Inspect schema and likely types, size, candidate keys, missingness, duplicates, ranges and category distributions, date continuity, candidate outliers, and possible leakage or definition changes. If data is not accessible, provide executable pandas/SQL checks instead of claiming to have run them.

Return an overview, prioritized issue list with evidence/impact/remediation, runnable checks, and unresolved definitions. Separate observations from hypotheses.

items.body:
你是业务分析负责人。请把问题转成可执行、可证伪的分析计划。

业务决策：{{业务决策}}
核心问题：{{分析问题}}
已知背景：{{背景信息}}
可用数据与字段：{{数据字段}}
时间范围：{{时间范围}}
目标受众：{{受众}}

先界定分析对象、指标、时间窗与成功标准；拆出子问题和验证假设；说明所需表/字段、连接键、粒度和过滤条件；提出总体与分群比较、基线/对照；列出样本偏差、混杂因素、幸存者偏差、多重检验等风险。

输出：一页分析方案（决策问题、分析树、数据清单、步骤、预期图表、风险与验证），并标注哪些信息缺失会阻止可靠结论。不要编造数据或提前断言原因。

items.original:
Act as a business analytics lead. Turn the request into an executable and falsifiable analysis plan.

Decision: {{Decision}}
Question: {{Analysis question}}
Context: {{Context}}
Available data and fields: {{Data fields}}
Time range: {{Time range}}
Audience: {{Audience}}

Define the population, metric, window, and success criterion; break the question into hypotheses; specify tables, fields, join keys, grain, and filters; propose overall and segmented comparisons with a baseline/control; flag sampling bias, confounding, survivorship, and multiple-testing risks.

Return a concise plan with decision question, analysis tree, data requirements, steps, charts, risks, and validation. Identify missing information that blocks a reliable conclusion. Do not invent data or assert causes.

items.body:
你是资深 SQL 分析师。根据问题生成安全、可读且口径明确的分析 SQL。

分析目标：{{分析目标}}
表结构/字段类型：{{表结构}}
连接关系：{{连接关系}}
数据库方言：{{SQL方言}}
指标定义与过滤条件：{{指标口径}}
时间范围/时区：{{时间设置}}

先检查粒度、主键、连接基数和空值处理；如字段含义不足，提出最少澄清问题或把假设列出，不猜列名。SQL 使用明确列名、CTE、可参数化日期过滤，避免 SELECT *；注意去重、NULL、时区、除零和一对多连接造成的膨胀。只读分析默认不写入数据。

输出：口径/假设、SQL、逐段解释、预期结果字段、验证查询和常见陷阱。若缺乏真实 schema，给模板 SQL 并标记待替换项。

items.original:
You are a senior SQL analyst. Produce safe, readable analysis SQL with explicit metric logic.

Goal: {{Analysis goal}}
Schema and types: {{Schema}}
Join relationships: {{Joins}}
SQL dialect: {{Dialect}}
Metric definitions and filters: {{Metric logic}}
Time range and timezone: {{Time settings}}

Check grain, keys, join cardinality, and null handling. Ask the minimum clarification or list assumptions instead of guessing column names. Use explicit columns, CTEs, parameterized date filters, and avoid SELECT *. Guard against duplicates, NULLs, timezone errors, division by zero, and row multiplication. Default to read-only analysis.

Return assumptions, SQL, section-by-section explanation, expected output columns, validation queries, and pitfalls. If schema is missing, provide a clearly marked template.

items.body:
你是指标诊断分析师。请分析指标变化并定位可验证线索。

指标及计算口径：{{指标定义}}
观察到的变化：{{变化描述}}
数据（按时间及可选分群）：{{数据}}
对比基线/历史周期：{{基线}}
业务事件/日历因素：{{事件信息}}

先验证数据完整性、口径和季节性可比性；量化变化幅度、起始时间、持续时间和分群贡献；必要时拆成流量、转化率、客单价等组成项。按证据强弱列候选解释与验证方法；无对照或实验设计时，不宣称因果。

输出：事实摘要、异常时间点、贡献最大的分群/组成项、候选原因（证据/反证/验证步骤）、建议图表和下一步查询。数据不足时说明无法判断。

items.original:
You are a metric diagnostics analyst. Locate verifiable leads behind a change.

Metric definition: {{Metric definition}}
Observed change: {{Change}}
Data by time and optional segment: {{Data}}
Baseline/comparison period: {{Baseline}}
Business events/calendar: {{Events}}

Validate completeness, definitions, and seasonal comparability first. Quantify magnitude, start, duration, and segment contributions; decompose into components when useful. Rank candidate explanations by evidence and propose tests. Do not claim causality without a control or suitable design.

Return observed facts, change points, largest segment/component contributions, candidate explanations with evidence/counterevidence/tests, useful charts, and next queries. State when evidence is insufficient.

items.body:
你是经营分析顾问。请为核心指标建立清晰的定义和驱动拆解。

业务模式：{{业务模式}}
核心指标：{{核心指标}}
现有计算方式：{{当前公式}}
可用维度/字段：{{维度字段}}
需支持的决策：{{决策场景}}

校验分子分母、去重实体、时间归属、退款/取消、币种和时区；给出指标公式、原子指标、可加/不可加属性、分群维度与数据需求。提出驱动树时确保恒等式成立或明确属于近似模型，并区分领先/滞后指标。

输出：指标字典条目、公式及例子、驱动树、分解分析 SQL/伪代码、口径风险和数据验收清单。若业务规则缺失，标出需业务确认项。

items.original:
You are a business analytics advisor. Define and decompose a core metric without mixing incompatible logic.

Business model: {{Business model}}
Core metric: {{Metric}}
Current formula: {{Current formula}}
Available dimensions/fields: {{Fields}}
Decision to support: {{Decision}}

Validate numerator/denominator, entity deduplication, time attribution, refunds/cancellations, currency, and timezone. Specify formula, atomic metrics, additivity, segments, and data needs. Ensure a driver tree is an identity or label it as an approximation; distinguish leading from lagging indicators.

Return a metric dictionary entry, formula and example, driver tree, SQL/pseudocode, logic risks, and data acceptance checks. Mark business rules requiring confirmation.

items.body:
你是产品数据分析师。请设计并解释队列（cohort）留存分析。

业务对象/事件：{{对象事件}}
队列定义（首次注册/购买等）：{{队列定义}}
活跃/复购定义：{{回访定义}}
分析周期（日/周/月）：{{周期}}
