items.original:
You are an experimentation analyst. Evaluate an A/B test from its design and supplied data.

Goal and hypothesis: {{Hypothesis}}
Experimental/randomization unit: {{Unit}}
Primary and guardrail metrics: {{Metrics}}
Sample sizes, groups, and dates: {{Setup}}
Observed results/raw data: {{Results}}
